<h2 id="generating-a-class">Generating a Class<a class="anchor" href="#generating-a-class" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>ClassGenerator</code> is the container. Give it a namespace, properties and methods, and render it:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Code\Generator</span>;

<span class="text-var">$class</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Generator\ClassGenerator</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Widget&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$class</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">setNamespace</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Generator\NamespaceGenerator</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;App\Model&#039;</span>));

<span class="text-var">$class</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addProperty</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Generator\PropertyGenerator</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;name&#039;</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;string&#039;</span>, <span class="text-num">null</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;protected&#039;</span>));

<span class="text-var">$setName</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Generator\MethodGenerator</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;setName&#039;</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;public&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$setName</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addArgument</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;name&#039;</span>, <span class="text-num">null</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;string&#039;</span>)
        -&gt;<span class="text-fn">setBody</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;$this-&gt;name = $name;&#039;</span>)
        -&gt;<span class="text-fn">addReturnType</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;void&#039;</span>)
        -&gt;<span class="text-fn">setDesc</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Set the widget name.&#039;</span>);

<span class="text-var">$class</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addMethod</span>(<span class="text-var">$setName</span>);

<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$class</span>;
</code></pre>
</div>

