<p><code>InterfaceGenerator</code>, <code>TraitGenerator</code> and <code>EnumGenerator</code> are the same shape. An interface's methods
render as semicolon-terminated signatures with no body, and its parents come from a second constructor
argument taking an array or a comma-separated string:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
