<p>A trait takes properties and methods but has no <code>extends</code>, <code>implements</code>, abstract, final or readonly
flag. An enum takes a backing type and <code>EnumCaseGenerator</code> cases, and can carry constants, methods and
implemented interfaces exactly as a class does. Leave the backing type off for a pure enum:</p>
<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">use</span> <span class="text-type">Pop\Code\Generator</span>;

<span class="text-var">$enum</span> = <span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Generator\EnumGenerator</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Status&#039;</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;string&#039;</span>);
<span class="text-var">$enum</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addCase</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Generator\EnumCaseGenerator</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Active&#039;</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;active&#039;</span>));
<span class="text-var">$enum</span>-&gt;<span class="text-fn">addCase</span>(<span class="text-kw">new</span> <span class="text-type">Generator\EnumCaseGenerator</span>(<span class="text-str">&#039;Inactive&#039;</span>, <span class="text-str">&#039;inactive&#039;</span>));

<span class="text-kw">echo</span> <span class="text-var">$enum</span>;
</code></pre>
</div>

<div class="code-window" x-data="copyCode">
<div class="code-window-bar"><span class="code-lang">PHP</span><button type="button" class="code-copy" @click="copy()" :aria-label="copied ? 'Copied' : 'Copy code'" aria-label="Copy code"><svg x-show="!copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11.5" height="11.5" rx="2.4"></rect><path d="M15 5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 12.4 3H5.6A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 3 5.6v6.8A2.6 2.6 0 0 0 5.6 15"></path></svg><svg x-show="copied" x-cloak class="code-copied" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5 9 17l10.5-10.5"></path></svg></button></div>
<pre><code><span class="text-kw">enum</span> <span class="text-type">Status</span>: <span class="text-type">string</span>
{

    <span class="text-kw">case</span> <span class="text-type">Active</span> = <span class="text-str">&#039;active&#039;</span>;

    <span class="text-kw">case</span> <span class="text-type">Inactive</span> = <span class="text-str">&#039;inactive&#039;</span>;

}
</code></pre>
